        </iframe>
    </div>
    <div id="instructions" class="container instructions-container">
        <h2>Help! How do I play?</h2>
        <div class="instructions">
            <div>
                <img loading="lazy" src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}solitaire/images/SolitaireTutorial-1.png`} alt="What each suit and dragon looks like">
                <p>To win, stack the three suits from 1 to 9 in the top right corner of the table, and stack four of each of the three dragons in the free cell slots</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <img loading="lazy" src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}solitaire/images/SolitaireTutorial-2.png`} alt="What stacked cards look like in the center of the table">
                <p>Cards can be stacked and moved in the center of the table, but only if they are of alternating suits and decreasing values.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <img loading="lazy" src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}solitaire/images/SolitaireTutorial-3.png`} alt="What the free cells look like with dragon and suit cards in it">
                <p>The free cells in the top-left corner of the table can store one card of any type.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <img loading="lazy" src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}solitaire/images/SolitaireTutorial-4.png`} alt="What happens when you press the corresponding button to move a set of dragon cards to a free cell">
                <p>When all four dragons of a single type are exposed, they can all be permanently moved to an open free cell by pushing the corresponding button.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
